  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">광주, 고가연 선생님~ 고맙습니다. </span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">선생님이 올리신 자료를 보고 우리학교도 그렇게 해 보았더니 재미있는 아이디어 많이 나오네요.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff2a87053da4ff6501a3df6cd5d44edc2ae549ec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ff2a87053da4ff6501a3df6cd5d44edc2ae549ec\" data-origin-width=\"567\" data-origin-height=\"425\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2104C7355832984315\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2104C7355832984315\" data-origin-width=\"567\" data-origin-height=\"756\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/266A4537583298513C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/266A4537583298513C\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2209C4355832985C11\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2209C4355832985C11\" data-origin-width=\"567\" data-origin-height=\"425\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2755B6395832986714\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2755B6395832986714\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/235A24365832987011\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/235A24365832987011\" data-origin-width=\"567\" data-origin-height=\"425\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0780a33281345982605c34b9aa9a44412c8ba52\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0780a33281345982605c34b9aa9a44412c8ba52\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">나홀로 참여, 두 명이 한 팀, 네 명이 한 팀, 이렇게 희망대로&#160;한 작품씩&#160;완성한 후 발표하였고요.&#160;&#160;&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">얼마나 열중하였던지 출입문이 없는 작품도 나왔습니다.&#160;출입문의 위치를 묻는 질문에 순간 당황하였으면서도 집 뒤쪽에 있다고&#160;둘러대는(?) 순발력도 발휘하였습니다.&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">아이들의 상상력은&#160;&#160;무한합니다. 이런 아이들과 함께 살아가는 일상이 행복합니다. ^^</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24024F375832982C27\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24024F375832982C27\" data-origin-width=\"567\" data-origin-height=\"425\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
